{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18106270","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18106270","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1810627001:0":{"text":"バンティスの風習はノヴァリスとは違うとお聞きしましたが、本当ですか？","source_cn":"听闻班题斯的习俗与诺珐斯不同，是真的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8665EFE531B69C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1810627002:0":{"text":"ああ。だがまったく違うというわけでもない。","source_cn":"有所区别，却也没到天差地别的程度。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1761927FEEEC42D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810627003:1":{"text":"生者がバンティスを治めていた頃は、私のように死後グレイヴボーンとなった者がここへ移り住むことも珍しくなかったからね。","source_cn":"在班题斯还由生者统治的时候，常有像我这样死后变成亡灵的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6690AFC6743C1A40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810627004:1":{"text":"当時、バンティスとノヴァリスの間には広大な無主地があったんだが、今はすべてバンティスに占領されてしまった。","source_cn":"想当时，班题斯和诺珐斯之间还存在着一大片无主之地，可惜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCAC7ECC64691A49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810627005:1":{"text":"まさか彼らがここまで強引だったなんて……領主様に先手を打つよう進言していれば、今のように受け身に回ることもなかったでしょうに……","source_cn":"早知道他们这么强势，咱们真该劝领主阁下抢先一步，现在就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CAD20CF763BC5B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_fe